  "details": "IDK how many time... I can't rejoin my friend in their instance because of: timeout, SteamVR error occured, and so on, there is always something to prevent me to rejoin my friend in their \"private world\"...\n\nThis is sooo annoying you can't imagin, mostly when friend are asleep...\n\nSo I create this canny, to implement something to change that like:\n\n- A \"timeout system\", when you disconnect for IDK reason, you can regain access to a world in a limited period of time.\n\n- when you gain access to an instance, you can rejoin anytime you want (until you are kicked)\n\n- A button in parameter, when you are \"instance master\" of a \"friend+\",\"friend\",\"invit+\",\"invit\" you can permit other to rejoin instance if they disconnect...\n\nI am open to any discution about that.",
